#: R/cox.b.R
msgid ""
"C-index: probability that, of two patients, the one who has the event first "
"has the higher predicted risk (0.5 = chance, 1 = perfect)."
msgstr ""
"Índice C: probabilidad de que, de dos pacientes, el que presenta antes el "
"evento tenga el mayor riesgo predicho (0.5 = azar, 1 = perfecto)."

